{
  "comment": [
    "One row for each of the 78 decisions that bootstrap0/src/check.c and",
    "check_stmt.c cited at 39a58dd8^, the last tree with citations, and one row",
    "for each of the six spec sections that tree cited by number with a rule that",
    "no decision row breaks (grammar-4, module-system-8.1, module-system-8.3,",
    "toolchain-7.3, toolchain-9.2, item3). D3.11b, D5.5b, D6.9b, D6.10b",
    "and D8.5b to D8.5e are second-facet rows: D3.11b refuses a suffix on a",
    "group of void in a return type, D5.5b gives a mut on a void return type the",
    "message of i32 mut, D6.9b widens a rule, the D6.10",
    "mutant crashes a suite, D8.5b is the D8.5 site that reports a noreturn in a",
    "group, as in (noreturn*), D8.5c reports a mut on a noreturn or void return",
    "type, and D8.5d and D8.5e keep each noreturn type to one report. 39a58dd8",
    "removed the citations and kept the code, so each row names the line that",
    "carried the rule. The stages run from the",
    "cheapest to the widest: the checker suites, every bootstrap0 suite, then the",
    "chain, which builds bootstrap-1 and HEAD with the mutant. The table runs on a",
    "darwin host with --runner 'bash -c'. ZERO_AR_DATE=1 makes the darwin link",
    "reproducible, so the md5 guard holds."
  ],
  "sources": [
    "bootstrap0/src/check.c",
    "bootstrap0/src/check_stmt.c"
  ],
  "binary": "build/Darwin/debug/bootstrap/fort",
  "build": "ZERO_AR_DATE=1 ninja -C build/Darwin/debug fort_bootstrap0 fort_bootstrap0_unit_tests",
